{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes: Mali is a sweet girl who transitioned from the outdoor life to a professional indoor lovebug. She made herself at home instantly, greeting her foster parent with immediate purrs, chin rubs, and a high-tail salute.\nMali is an active explorer who loves to check out high places, track bugs, and watch the birds from the window. She is also an absolute prolific biscuit maker. When she's in a cuddly mood, the kneading just doesn't stop! She is vocal, confident, and completely unbothered by loud noises and moving things around.\nMali prefers playtime and cuddles over spa days. She can be a little sensitive about being brushed on her back, but she's making great progress and can be won over with a post-meal routine! She is comfortable with being picked up and nail-trimming sessions.\nMali has so much love to give and will make the ultimate companion for anyone looking for a sweet friend.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=8&searchType=4&animalid=202586","id":"62fb878afcec63fe53a6254ae0921e3b","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/cc27bfbf333c403c9ea3bc194a9dd5d2-1786979859-1786979962-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/860293ebbee8433998f82a85e8157043-1786979859-1786979943-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/72858249046a417b959c08f2ca02ac8c-1786979862-1786979862-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/2b649377edff44d1a56f728811af4478-1786979861-1786979861-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e0bdde8fb7364679b01686acffd39a9d-1786979861-1786979861-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/stor